  "description": "Woo-Un is a member of an unsuccessful idol group about to end their contract for good. As a final bid to save their careers, the group resorts to enacting gay fanservice to boost their popularity. When Woo-Un is paired with fellow group member Jae-Sam to play-act as a couple, he’s secretly delighted. He has a crush on Jae-Sam, and this is the perfect opportunity to sneak in some justified physical affection. However, Jae-Sam seems reluctant to play along. Will they be able to save their careers this way? And is there more at stake than Woo-Un is aware of?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of RIDI's Sengmotjung Danpyeonseon (섹못죽 단편선) Collection.*",
